# Written by the AnyFS lab's playbook: what the Atlassian setup, the seed and the smoke test read (KEY=value, unquoted).
# root's only. The licence keys are not here: LICENCES is the PC's folder of them, seen through the shared folder.
JIRA_URL=http://{{ machine.ip }}:{{ atlassian.jira.port }}{{ atlassian.jira.context_path }}
CONFLUENCE_URL=http://{{ machine.ip }}:{{ atlassian.confluence.port }}{{ atlassian.confluence.context_path }}
ADMIN_USER={{ atlassian.admin.user }}
ADMIN_PASSWORD={{ atlassian.admin.password }}
TESTER_USER={{ atlassian.tester.user }}
TESTER_PASSWORD={{ atlassian.tester.password }}
LICENCES=/vagrant/atlassian/licences
SECRETS=/vagrant/atlassian/secrets
FIXTURES=/vagrant/atlassian/fixtures
